	(text "FT231XS full-handshake UART, bus-powered. VCC = VBUS, VCCIO = 3V3OUT (3.3V I/O)\n27R series + 47pF on D+/D- per FTDI datasheet\nCBUS0-3 and DSR/DCD/RI left NC - configure CBUS via FT_PROG if needed\nLong factory lead times (27-42 wk) - check stock before committing"
